      "content": "i get that but my doctor is always so rushed/dismissive when i bring up stuff like this. i just want something natural that i know works. i heard it's mainly just for serotonin so how much of a risk is it really? like can i just take a small dose at night so it doesnt mess with my blood thinner too much?",
